    "media:imagetext": "MILLS ESTATE INCORPORATED\nMILLS BUILDING\nSAN FRANCISCO\nJune 2, 1927.\nCity and County of San Francisco,\ncity Hall,\nSan Francisco, California.\nAttention Joseph J. Phillips, Esq.,\nRight of Way Agent.\nGentlemen:\nAcknowledging the receipt of your\nletter of April\n26th, we beg\nto confirm the\noral permission heretofore given to you to\nmaintain,\nfor your own use, the telephone\nline on the poles of the power line leading\nto the San Francisco airport.\nThis permission is to continue\nduring the time that that power line is\nmaintained and during the term of your lease.\nVery truly yours,\nMILLS ESTATE INCORPORATED\nBy\nlear\nPresident",
